  "details": "Version: 2022.2.1p5\nWhen scaling an avatar root up/down, physbone radius usually scales to match, but sometimes will not. I've noticed bones with curve-assigned radius only scaling 100%-width joints, while other points' radii do not scale at all. Also had a case where a constant-radius bone turns into a cone as the avatar scales up; the base scales correctly, the tip does not.",
